  "text": "Iqa‘ Mudawwar Masri 12/4 Iqa‘ Mudawwar Shami 10/4 Iqa‘ Index Pronunciation of Mudawwar Iqa‘ Mudawwar is a popular iqa‘ in the Muwashah repertoire. The word \"mudawwar\" in Arabic means round/circular. Many forms of Iqa‘ Mudawwar are in use, among which Mudawwar Masri (Egyptian) in 12/4 and Mudawwar Shami (Damascene/pan-Syrian) in 10/4. Iqa‘ Mudawwar Masri 12/4 Muwashah Adhkuru al-Hibba Abdel Halim Noueira Ensemble Music by Dawud Husni (Egypt) Muwashah Fika Kullu Ma Ara Hasan Composed in Maqam Bayati Abdel Halim Noueira Ensemble Iqa‘ Mudawwar Masri 12/4 Tabla demonstration by Faisal Zedan Iqa‘ Mudawwar Shami 10/4 Muwashah Fika Kullu Ma Ara Hasan Composed in Maqam Hijaz Omar al-Sarmini Al-Kindi Ensemble Muwashah Fika Kullu Ma Ara Hasan Composed in Maqam Hijaz Sabah Fakhri",
